<title>USA: SIOUX CITY HOGS MIXED - USDA.</title>
<headline>SIOUX CITY HOGS MIXED - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts opened with 160 head selling $1.00 higher, remainder steady-0.50 lower.</p>
<p>Trade moderately active. Top $57.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3   220-270 lbs     55.50-57.00</p>
<p>	   270-280 lbs     55.00-55.50, mostly 55.50</p>
<p>US 2-3   280-300 lbs     52.50-54.00</p>
<p>US 3-4   300-330 lbs     49.00-52.00</p>
<p>Sows:  300-450 lbs 0.50 lower; 450-700 lbs steady-1.00 higher. Top 49.50.</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-450 lbs     45.50</p>
<p>	   450-500 lbs     48.50</p>
<p>	   500-550 lbs     49.00</p>
<p>	   550-700 lbs     49.50</p>
</text>
